        "type": "GPE"
      },
      "verb_pattern": "took over"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "In 1941, I remember it was afternoon, a neighbor came to us hastily and said that the German troops that entered the village, had shot my aunt Cecilia, her son Ficicu and my uncle Bubi, and told us to hide in his house.",
      "relationship_type": "killed_by",
