      },
      "object": {
        "entity": "typhoid fever",
        "type": "EVENT"
      },
      "verb_pattern": "fell ill with"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "In the meantime Irina had found out my name, came to the ghetto, bribed the sentry and showed him what she brought into the ghetto.",
