      "object": {
        "entity": "Copaigorod",
        "type": "GHETTO_LOCATION"
      },
      "verb_pattern": "took to"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I remember we were also in a place called Shargorod, but only briefly; it might have been that place where they dug the common grave, I'm not sure.",
