        "type": "PERSON"
      },
      "object": {
        "entity": "Irina",
        "type": "PERSON"
      },
      "verb_pattern": "said goodbye to"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "When we came back to Cuciurul Mare in 1944, we just found wasteland: our house had been demolished.",
